-* [DOC] for new or updated documentation
-* [ENH] for enhancements
-* [FIX] for bug fixes
-* [TST] for new or updated tests
-* [REF] for refactoring existing code
-* [MAINT] for maintenance of code
-* [WIP] for work in progress
